  help: Every widget on this path passes its input to its output combinationally, so the signal has no register to wait at and the loop has no start.  Break it by registering one of the hops -- a
        `dff::DFF` on any edge is enough -- or by restructuring so the widgets are not mutually dependent within a cycle.
